<!--
    The people glyph a group wears when it has neither a photo nor enough members to draw as a cluster.

    Material Symbols' "group" (Apache-2.0), the same glyph `Icons.Filled.Group` ships, redrawn here as a
    resource because it is needed in two worlds: Compose reads it through `ui/icons/KnitIcons.Group`, and
    `MessageNotifier` paints it onto the shade's fallback disc, where a Compose `ImageVector` cannot go. One
    resource keeps the two from drifting apart. Black paint — every consumer tints it (ADR 2026-09.zapp).
-->
